      "content": "thanks, that really puts my mind at ease. it's just been a bit of an uncomfortable few days. the discomfort has definitely picked up lately, and it's getting kind of sharp whenever i move or try to sit up. i also noticed my temp is slightly up, like 99.6. since you mentioned the firmness is part of the healing, do you think it's okay if i just take some extra acetaminophen or maybe use a heating pad to help with the sharpness? i'm really trying to just sleep through this stage so i can recover faster.",
